name: lot-archive-databases
description: "Databases → Lot Archive: the pre-BC lot history (sheet import streamed from R2 + a website pull that matches LotIDs and photos by AuctionID + lot number). Read before touching archive import, the site pull, or anything that wants old sold prices/photos."
